From e40da128e35c1755fdbb35c268e71c055c08132d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: author <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:38:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] occamy-fused: moe_v3 shexp gate/up rows in the phase-A
 idle wave (GGML_CUDA_MOE_V3_SHIDLE, A2)

Env-gated (default off, needs GGML_CUDA_MOE_V3): moe_v3<true, true> computes the first nsa
shared-expert gate/up rows in the idle warp slots of the last router wave (nsa = 508 at grid 48);
phase B starts at task nsa. Same per-row dot/silu code (moe3_gu_row), base moe_v3<true, false>
SASS unchanged vs bundle9. Counter: MOE_V3_SHIDLE launches N grid G nsa K (OCCAMY_DEBUG).
CHECK additionally compares against base moe_v3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/occamy-fused.cu  | 111 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/occamy-fused.cuh |   1 +
 2 files changed, 104 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/occamy-fused.cu b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/occamy-fused.cu
index 8f00199..9bb1c95 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/occamy-fused.cu
